  "importMode": "merge",
  "note": "XFJ-01 Shiranui Second as its own frame. Moves Shiranui Second (as Type-04), XFJ Phase 1, Phase 3 and Shiranui Kai off the Type-94 onto mdl-xfj01, keeping their art, stats and loadouts, and adds the two Phase 2 airframes. Load with Restore from backup.",
